[{"text": "I now give the floor to his excellency", "start": 0.96, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "Tong Sawan", "start": 5.52, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "Pomvia,", "start": 7.44, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of", "start": 9.12, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "Foreign Affairs of the Lao People's", "start": 11.679, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "Democratic Republic.", "start": 14.719, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "Mr. President, at the outset, allow me", "start": 49.52, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "to express my warmest congratulation", "start": 53.52, "duration": 10.719}, {"text": "to his excellency Dr. Khal Khalu Rahman", "start": 57.12, "duration": 9.359}, {"text": "uh", "start": 64.239, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "on his election as a president of the", "start": 66.479, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "81st session of the United Nation", "start": 69.04, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "General general assembly.", "start": 71.84, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "My delegation assure you of our full", "start": 74.24, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "support and cooperation throughout your", "start": 76.96, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "presidency. And I also express our deep", "start": 79.759, "duration": 6.601}, {"text": "appreciation", "start": 83.36, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "to her excellency", "start": 86.4, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Analena", "start": 89.36, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "Analena Berbok for her dedicated", "start": 91.52, "duration": 8.44}, {"text": "leadership during the 80s session.", "start": 95.119, "duration": 4.841}, {"text": "The theme for this session, restoring", "start": 100.56, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "trust,", "start": 104.4, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "managing transformation, United Nation", "start": 106.159, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "that delivers for all arise at the", "start": 108.32, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "pivotal junction for developing and", "start": 112.479, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "vulnerable countries", "start": 116.399, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "when resources and responsive United", "start": 118.88, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "Nation is an indispensable anchor.", "start": 121.92, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "Restoring trust in our international", "start": 126.079, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "system required us to uphold predictable", "start": 129.759, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "support, honor comm commitments, and", "start": 133.2, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "reaffirm our fidelity to the", "start": 136.48, "duration": 9.0}, {"text": "UN charter.", "start": 142.08, "duration": 3.4}, {"text": "For the LA Pedia,", "start": 146.0, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "restoring", "start": 148.16, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "and deepening trust begin with renewed", "start": 149.76, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "commitment to inclusive", "start": 153.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "multilateralism with the United Nation", "start": 155.84, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "at the core.", "start": 158.72, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "When dialogue is guided by mutual", "start": 160.64, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "respect, transparency and", "start": 162.879, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "genuine cooperation, multilateralism", "start": 167.12, "duration": 8.8}, {"text": "yields tangible benefit for all people.", "start": 170.8, "duration": 8.6}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 175.92, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "our world continue to confront severe", "start": 179.76, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "multi- faceted tensions,", "start": 183.599, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "geopolitical", "start": 187.28, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "crisis and tension, microeconomic", "start": 189.519, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "instability, supply chain disruption and", "start": 192.4, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "accelerating climate emergencies.", "start": 196.48, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "These headwinds", "start": 200.56, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "place immense strain on the most", "start": 202.48, "duration": 8.8}, {"text": "vulnerable economies where rising energy", "start": 206.56, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "and food prices jeopardize the", "start": 211.28, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "livelihood of millions of people in", "start": 213.84, "duration": 8.28}, {"text": "countries in special situation.", "start": 216.959, "duration": 5.161}, {"text": "The ongoing conflicts", "start": 222.56, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "in the Middle East", "start": 225.04, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "demonstrate", "start": 227.2, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "how rapidly confrontation can dis uh", "start": 229.28, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "destabilize global stability.", "start": 232.4, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Sustainable peace cannot be fought", "start": 235.28, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "through force", "start": 238.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "or unilateral action. It requires", "start": 240.64, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "diplomacy, respect for surveillance", "start": 243.68, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "equality and territorial integrity and", "start": 246.799, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "strict adher adherence to international", "start": 250.64, "duration": 6.519}, {"text": "law.", "start": 254.159, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "The question of Palestine", "start": 257.359, "duration": 6.761}, {"text": "remain an in", "start": 260.16, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "enduring test of multilateral", "start": 264.24, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "credibility.", "start": 266.32, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "We remain deeply concerned by", "start": 268.56, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "humanitarian catastrophe and a means", "start": 271.28, "duration": 8.52}, {"text": "reconstruction requirement in Gaza", "start": 274.56, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "as well as uh mounting challenges in the", "start": 280.08, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "West Bank", "start": 283.6, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "to prevent the two-state uh solution", "start": 285.919, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "from", "start": 288.72, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "slipping beyond", "start": 290.32, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "the reach. The intern uh the", "start": 294.639, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "international community must secure a", "start": 297.52, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "just comprehensive and lasting peace", "start": 300.08, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "on", "start": 304.72, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "rasp speed and one that fulfills the", "start": 306.4, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "legitimate rights to the Palestinian", "start": 308.96, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "people to self-determination", "start": 310.72, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "through an independent state of", "start": 313.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Palestine with full membership in the", "start": 315.84, "duration": 6.52}, {"text": "United Nations.", "start": 318.72, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "In the same vein,", "start": 322.8, "duration": 8.76}, {"text": "the La Pedia reiterates its principle", "start": 325.52, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "position", "start": 331.68, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "against unilateral cohesive measures.", "start": 333.6, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "The prolong economic, commercial, and", "start": 338.96, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "financial embargo against the Republic", "start": 341.36, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "of Cuba continue to inflict hardship on", "start": 343.28, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "its people.", "start": 347.199, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "We call for the immediate and", "start": 349.44, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "unconditioned lifting the of these", "start": 351.52, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "sanctions including logistic and energy", "start": 354.32, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "blockades and removal of Cuba from the", "start": 357.36, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "list of state sponsored of terrorism.", "start": 361.28, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Such steps are essential first", "start": 365.44, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "humanitarian measures toward restoring", "start": 367.36, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "trust and reaffirming the", "start": 370.8, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "primacy of international law.", "start": 375.28, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 379.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the gap between commitments", "start": 381.919, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "and delivery on climate change equally", "start": 384.72, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "test the credibility of multilateralism.", "start": 387.36, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "Although the Lao Pediia has contributed", "start": 392.88, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "only a small share of global greenhouse", "start": 394.96, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "gas emissions, our people are", "start": 398.319, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "increasingly affected by floods,", "start": 401.36, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "droughts, and extreme weather", "start": 404.24, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "conditions.", "start": 407.6, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "The La Pedia remain fully committed to", "start": 410.08, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "the Paris agreement and its nationally", "start": 413.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "determined contributions.", "start": 416.08, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "However, climate ambitions must be", "start": 418.88, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "matched by adequate, predictable and", "start": 422.319, "duration": 7.481}, {"text": "accessible", "start": 426.8, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "climate finance, technology transfer and", "start": 429.919, "duration": 7.441}, {"text": "capacity building to enable vulnerable", "start": 434.08, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "developing states", "start": 437.36, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "to adopt to adapt build longterm", "start": 439.84, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "resilience and pursue long carbon growth", "start": 444.0, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "pathways.", "start": 447.52, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 450.0, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "the Laedia welcome the UN80s", "start": 452.72, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "initiative to enhance the co coherence,", "start": 457.039, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "transparency and effectiveness of the UN", "start": 461.12, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "system.", "start": 465.199, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Systematic reform must ensure a balanced", "start": 467.599, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "approach across the three pillars of", "start": 471.759, "duration": 3.601}, {"text": "organizations.", "start": 473.68, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "peace and security, sustainable", "start": 475.36, "duration": 8.04}, {"text": "development and human rights.", "start": 478.16, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "The implementation of the pack of the", "start": 484.639, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "future", "start": 487.28, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "and the global digitant compact must", "start": 488.96, "duration": 9.679}, {"text": "focus on narrowing the digital divide.", "start": 492.72, "duration": 8.319}, {"text": "Artificial intelligence and digital", "start": 498.639, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "technologies must serve human", "start": 501.039, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "development.", "start": 502.96, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "strengthen local techniques technical", "start": 504.639, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "capacities and respect national", "start": 506.879, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "development priorities.", "start": 510.08, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Mr. President, as an active member of", "start": 512.64, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "Association of Southeast Asian Nations,", "start": 516.0, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "the Laida reaffirm that a united", "start": 519.839, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "integrated ASEAN", "start": 523.76, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "serve as a cornerstone of regional peace", "start": 526.16, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "and multilateral stability.", "start": 530.08, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "We remain steadfast in supporting Assean", "start": 533.6, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "centrality within the involving regional", "start": 537.92, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "architecture where Asan le mechanism", "start": 540.959, "duration": 10.121}, {"text": "foster trust and practical cooperation.", "start": 545.279, "duration": 5.801}, {"text": "This year", "start": 552.24, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "carries special significance as we begin", "start": 554.72, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "implementing", "start": 557.519, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "the ASEAN community vision 2045", "start": 559.279, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "alongside its strategic plans across the", "start": 563.839, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "three community pillars. It also marks", "start": 567.2, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "the 50th anniversary of the treaty of", "start": 570.24, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "amiti and cooperation", "start": 572.8, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "in Southeast Asia.", "start": 576.32, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "A found a found a foundational framework", "start": 580.0, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "whose core principle of peace", "start": 584.08, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "coexistence and mutant respect remain", "start": 586.16, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "fully relevant today.", "start": 589.519, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "Assean remains the bedrock of the", "start": 592.88, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "laedia's regional engagement.", "start": 596.48, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "Mr. Present.", "start": 600.959, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "Despite severe external economic shocks", "start": 604.08, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "and natural disaster, the Lao economy", "start": 607.04, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "continues its steady recovery through", "start": 610.24, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "strong national ownership and strategic", "start": 613.44, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "international partnership.", "start": 616.16, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Guided by our sovereign and", "start": 618.88, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "self-reliance economic policy, the Lao", "start": 622.0, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "Pedia has adopted its 10th National", "start": 625.68, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Social Economic Development Plan for a", "start": 628.959, "duration": 7.32}, {"text": "period of 2026 and 2030.", "start": 631.36, "duration": 4.919}, {"text": "The 10th National Social Economic", "start": 636.64, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Development Plan focus on six core", "start": 639.12, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "national outcomes.", "start": 641.68, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "first", "start": 643.92, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "executing a surveillant and self-reliant", "start": 645.6, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "economic policy aiming for steady N1 GDP", "start": 648.079, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "growth of 6% or higher.", "start": 652.0, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "The second developing high quality human", "start": 655.92, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "resources capable of driving technology", "start": 659.92, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "trans transition.", "start": 662.72, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Third,", "start": 665.2, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "improving living standard, ensuring", "start": 667.04, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "balanced urban rural development and", "start": 669.44, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "alleviating poverty.", "start": 673.6, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Fourth,", "start": 676.24, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "protecting natural resources, building", "start": 678.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "climate resilience, and mitigating", "start": 680.64, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "disaster risk.", "start": 684.24, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Fifth, enhancing regional and global", "start": 687.519, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "economic integration and connectivity.", "start": 689.92, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "And six, strengthening the efficiency", "start": 693.92, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "and transparency of public", "start": 696.8, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "administration and governance.", "start": 698.48, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "Central to this strategy is the", "start": 702.959, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "transforming the LA PDR from the", "start": 705.2, "duration": 7.759}, {"text": "landlock countries into land link region", "start": 707.36, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "gateway", "start": 712.959, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "strategic infrastructure including the", "start": 715.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "Lao China Railway, the Lao Vietnam", "start": 717.839, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Railway project,", "start": 720.959, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "expanded transit corridors and access to", "start": 723.519, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "the sea via Bungang International Port", "start": 726.32, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "are actively ly driving regional trade", "start": 730.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "and integration.", "start": 732.639, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Our term our long-term vision toward", "start": 735.839, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "2055 aims to firmly establish", "start": 738.24, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "the laedia as an upper middle income", "start": 744.079, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "nation with a sustainable inclusive", "start": 746.56, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "growth and its core. Mr. President,", "start": 749.92, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "this year remark a landmark milestone in", "start": 754.48, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "our national development. The Laoida", "start": 757.2, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "remain fully committed to its formal", "start": 759.92, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "graduation from least developed country", "start": 762.88, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "status in accordance with relevant", "start": 764.8, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "general assembly resolution.", "start": 767.76, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "As the UN Secretary General Antonio", "start": 770.959, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "Gutes", "start": 773.2, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "rightly stated, LDC graduation must be a", "start": 775.04, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "reward, never a punishment.", "start": 779.68, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "To safeguard our hardworn development", "start": 783.6, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "gains and", "start": 786.079, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "prevent structural setbacks, we are", "start": 789.68, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "executing a robust smooth transition", "start": 792.639, "duration": 9.561}, {"text": "strategy for a period 2026 to 2029.", "start": 795.92, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "We call on our international partners to", "start": 802.56, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "provide predictable transition support", "start": 805.44, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "extend smoothly", "start": 808.88, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "adjustment regarding international", "start": 811.2, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "support measures.", "start": 814.32, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "I expand", "start": 816.959, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "concessional financing to build enduring", "start": 819.36, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "economic resilience.", "start": 822.8, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "The 2030 agenda for sustainable", "start": 826.079, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "development remains fully embedded", "start": 828.48, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "within our national planning", "start": 832.959, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "as we prepare to present our four", "start": 836.079, "duration": 9.281}, {"text": "voluntary national review at the 2027", "start": 840.56, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "high level political forum. We remain", "start": 845.36, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "dedicated to an open transparent", "start": 849.04, "duration": 7.239}, {"text": "assessment of our progress", "start": 852.32, "duration": 3.959}, {"text": "for the La Pedia.", "start": 856.88, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "The nexus between peace and development", "start": 859.04, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "is a", "start": 861.199, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "life experience.", "start": 863.519, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "As a country heavily impacted by wartime", "start": 866.56, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "cluster munition issues for over five", "start": 870.399, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "decades,", "start": 873.04, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "we have placed unexloded orans clearance", "start": 874.8, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "at the heart of our development agenda", "start": 878.72, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "through the national SDG18", "start": 881.519, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "lives", "start": 885.68, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "safe from UXO.", "start": 887.279, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "Removing UXO is not merely a technical", "start": 889.92, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "task. It's about restoring fundamental", "start": 892.56, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "safe safety and securing agricultural", "start": 896.079, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "land and reclaiming development", "start": 900.079, "duration": 7.241}, {"text": "opportunity for our communities.", "start": 902.48, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "Building on this commitment, the Lao", "start": 908.639, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Pedia proudly hosted the third review", "start": 910.959, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "conference of the convention on crust", "start": 914.079, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "demonition early this month in Viang", "start": 916.16, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Chan under the theme", "start": 919.68, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "accelerating progress towards the world", "start": 922.72, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "free from the threat of cluster", "start": 925.12, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "munitions.", "start": 927.199, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "Our presidency demonstrated that mind", "start": 929.519, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "action is an indispensable foundation", "start": 932.24, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "for poverty reduction. human dignity and", "start": 935.199, "duration": 7.721}, {"text": "sustainable development.", "start": 939.36, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "Mr. President", "start": 942.959, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "as a secretary general", "start": 944.959, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "Antonio Gutes prepared to complete his", "start": 947.36, "duration": 8.479}, {"text": "uh distinguished tenor at the help of", "start": 951.6, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "our organization. The government and the", "start": 955.839, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "people of the Lao Pedia wish to express", "start": 958.56, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "our profound appreciation and heartfelt", "start": 961.519, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "gratitude for his principle", "start": 965.12, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "leadership, morren clarity and", "start": 968.48, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "unwavering dedication to the United", "start": 971.279, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "Nation. A true and trusted friend of the", "start": 974.079, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "Lao Pedia and fellow peaceloving", "start": 978.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "developing nations across the south a", "start": 981.12, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "global south.", "start": 984.0, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "Secretary General Gutes will be warmly", "start": 986.24, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "remembered for his tireless advocacy for", "start": 988.959, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "international financial architecture", "start": 993.839, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "reform, climate justice,", "start": 995.839, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "sustainable development financing", "start": 1000.16, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "and the digital uh", "start": 1002.959, "duration": 8.721}, {"text": "and dignity of the countries in special", "start": 1008.16, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "situation.", "start": 1011.68, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "His legacy of solidarity and", "start": 1013.759, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "bold championing of", "start": 1018.56, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "equity would continue to inspire our", "start": 1021.92, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "collective multilateral effort for years", "start": 1025.12, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "to come.", "start": 1028.48, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Mr. President, in conclusion, the Laedia", "start": 1030.24, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "firmly believes that", "start": 1034.0, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "the United Nations remain the essential", "start": 1036.319, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "home of global cooperation.", "start": 1038.799, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "No single nation can overcome today's", "start": 1043.199, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "complex global challenges alone. Let us", "start": 1045.919, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "unite", "start": 1049.44, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "our collective strength, renew our trust", "start": 1051.44, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "in multilateralism", "start": 1055.039, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "and work together to build a peaceful,", "start": 1056.88, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "resilient and prosperous world where no", "start": 1059.919, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "nation and people is left behind. I", "start": 1064.08, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "thank you.", "start": 1067.039, "duration": 3.161}, {"text": "I thank the deputy prime minister and", "start": 1079.44, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "minister of foreign affairs of the Lao", "start": 1081.52, "duration": 6.92}, {"text": "People's Democratic Republic.", "start": 1083.919, "duration": 4.521}, {"text": "I now give the", "start": 1089.28, "duration": 2.88}]